{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855040/extras/b0539edaf2460c7064ff77bc33d7f9cb.avif?t=1764183314\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Crow Style is a pixelated stealth side-scroller where you play as an egocentric crow with one goal: to ruin a prestigious fashion contest. Sneak into your rivals' homes and destroy their creations! But to achieve your objective, you\u2019ll need to master the pinnacle of stealth: the art of disguise. <br><br><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855040/extras/1570af435e6b6a6dcb8266b927a1b065.avif?t=1764183314\" width=181 height=181 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak into rival designers\u2019 homes,</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple environments to infiltrate and explore. <strong>-Use disguises and hide.</strong> Wear different skins to confuse and avoid your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855040/extras/f2cce0ada70f0ffc93162668caf44b63.avif?t=1764183314\" width=182 height=182 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruin your rivals\u2019 clothes without being seen,</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > To complete your mission, leave the outfits in true Crow Style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855040/extras/9f2fa0925841c67f1af2474e89bc2887.avif?t=1764183314\" width=182 height=182 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the contestants\u2019 secrets and escape before you\u2019re caught!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Read letters scattered around the levels to find the best ways to sabotage your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855040/extras/3b0db0aafbbd22cea67976a227ef91b8.avif?t=1764183314\" width=187 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong> In a city where fashion is more than just art \u2014 it's power, influence, and prestige \u2014 there\u2019s a contest capable of turning designers into living legends. And you, of course, won\u2019t miss this chance.  <br> <br>You are <strong>Edgar</strong>, an egocentric, snobbish crow absolutely obsessed with social status. For you, winning is more than a matter of talent\u2026 it\u2019s about eliminating the competition in style! the crow loves to play: silent sabotage, surgical alteration of every rival\u2019s outfit, and a stylish strike pulled off with class in the shadows!  <br> <br>Each house is a world of its own, filled with eccentric designers and unique styles. Be very careful \u2014 being seen might not end well for your reputation! After all, in the fashion world, the worst crime is getting caught red-handed.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855040/extras/9a75f28bf86cd241e0f066f08676bc22.avif?t=1764183314\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming pixel art visuals,</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharp humor,</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic stealth-based gameplay,</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and unique atmosphere</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855040?t=1764183314","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855040/f21da507e885945d67d87c97ed6c5ff38a21cf15/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764183314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855040/405c40bb7828190b0bfa78ff40fe3a06424de66e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764183314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855040/405c40bb7828190b0bfa78ff40fe3a06424de66e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764183314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4121580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855040/extras/b0539edaf2460c7064ff77bc33d7f9cb.avif?t=1764183314\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>Crow Style is a pixelated stealth side-scroller where you play as an egocentric crow with one goal: to ruin a prestigious fashion contest. Sneak into your rivals' homes and destroy their creations! But to achieve your objective, you\u2019ll need to master the pinnacle of stealth: the art of disguise. <br><br><strong>Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855040/extras/1570af435e6b6a6dcb8266b927a1b065.avif?t=1764183314\" width=181 height=181 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneak into rival designers\u2019 homes,</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"b